    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">01 · Scheduler 隔离事务</p>
      <h1>同一个 <code>ScheduleBatch</code> 可以临时变成 Target Verify 视图，但不能把临时视图带到下一轮</h1>
      <p class="lead"><code>Scheduler._forward_isolation()</code> 不是模型算法，而是一次事务边界：先保存 Scheduler 的持久视图，允许 dSpark worker 临时重绑字段，worker 完整返回后恢复，再只提交已经验证过的跨轮状态。</p>
      <div class="evidence-strip"><span><strong>当前对象</strong> <code>batch = plan.batch_to_run : ScheduleBatch</code>，不是 <code>Req</code> 列表，也不等同于 <code>scheduler.running_batch</code></span><span><strong>默认示例</strong> non-overlap · CUDA dSpark V2 · PP=1 · decode</span><span><strong>证据边界</strong> checkout f01a0c7f97ec · 静态源码核验 · 未执行 GPU 运行时验证</span></div>
      <div class="route-switch" aria-label="选择讲解路线"><button type="button" data-route-choice="static-greedy">STATIC · 贪心</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="compact-sampling">COMPACT · 随机采样</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="folded-greedy">FOLDED · 贪心</button></div>
      <div data-semantic-legend></div>
    </header>

    <section class="handoff" aria-label="Scheduler 隔离交接契约">
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>输入</b><span><code>batch_to_run : ScheduleBatch</code>，Scheduler 已准备好的本轮可执行批次</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>临时变化</b><span><code>input_ids/spec_info/forward_mode/seq_lens/sampling_info</code> 可在 worker 内被重绑</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>返回</b><span><code>batch_result : GenerationBatchResult</code>；退出隔离区时 batch 已恢复</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>持久提交</b><span>non-overlap 写回 <code>next_draft_input/new_seq_lens</code>；overlap 走 <code>FutureMap</code></span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="transaction-flow">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">主视图 · 对象状态调用泳道</p><h2><code>resolve → snapshot → 临时重绑 → ForwardBatch 捕获 → restore → commit</code></h2><p class="section__intro">泳道明确区分“同一个 Scheduler 对象被临时重绑”和“新构造的 ForwardBatch 已经持有执行所需引用”。选择 STATIC、COMPACT 或 FOLDED 不改变这层事务顺序。</p></div>
      <div class="visual stepper" data-stepper data-steps="8">
        <div class="visual__bar"><strong>non-overlap decode · 一次完整隔离事务</strong><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#isolation-board">放大主图</button></div>
        <div class="visual__body">
          <div class="stepper__toolbar"><div class="stepper__buttons" aria-label="隔离流程播放控制"><button type="button" data-step-action="prev">上一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="next">下一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="play">播放</button><button type="button" data-step-action="reset">重置</button></div><div class="stepper__progress" aria-hidden="true"><span data-step-progress></span></div><div class="stepper__status" data-step-status aria-live="polite"></div></div>
          <div class="step-copyline" aria-live="polite">
            <div data-step-copy="0"><b>第 1 步 · 解析入口</b> non-overlap 也调用 <code>resolve_forward_inputs()</code>；纯 dSpark decode 的三个 guard 都不成立，所以是 guard-only no-op。</div>
            <div data-step-copy="1"><b>第 2 步 · 保存</b> 对 spec V2 的全部 dataclass 字段做浅快照，并把 <code>sampling_info</code> 换成 forward-only copy。</div>
            <div data-step-copy="2"><b>第 3 步 · 动态分派</b> <code>scheduler.model_worker</code> 的运行时接收者是 <code>DSparkWorkerV2</code>，不是 Target 的 <code>TpModelWorker</code>。</div>
            <div data-step-copy="3"><b>第 4 步 · 临时视图</b> <code>DFlashVerifyInput.prepare_for_verify()</code> 把同一 batch 临时改成 <code>TARGET_VERIFY</code> 并构造独立 <code>verify_forward_batch</code>。</div>
            <div data-step-copy="4"><b>第 5 步 · 模型完成</b> Target 计算、接受与 Draft KV 提交都在 worker 返回前完成，结果被装进 <code>GenerationBatchResult</code>。</div>
            <div data-step-copy="5"><b>第 6 步 · 恢复</b> <code>finally</code> 恢复 Scheduler 字段；重绑 batch 字段不会修改 ForwardBatch 已捕获的 tensor 对象。</div>
            <div data-step-copy="6"><b>第 7 步 · 持久提交</b> 恢复之后再写 <code>next_draft_input/new_seq_lens</code>；顺序反过来会把新状态覆盖掉。</div>
            <div data-step-copy="7"><b>第 8 步 · 下一消费者</b> 恢复后的 <code>forward_mode=DECODE</code> 使 <code>Scheduler.process_batch_result()</code> 正确进入 decode handler。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="swim-scroll" id="isolation-board"><div class="isolation-board" role="table" aria-label="Scheduler 前向隔离对象状态调用泳道">
            <div class="iso-head" role="row"><div class="iso-head__corner" role="columnheader">时间</div><div role="columnheader"><span class="instance">scheduler : Scheduler</span><span class="fqcn">sglang.srt.managers.scheduler.Scheduler</span></div><div role="columnheader"><span class="instance">batch_to_run : ScheduleBatch</span><span class="fqcn">sglang.srt.managers.schedule_batch.ScheduleBatch</span></div><div role="columnheader"><span class="instance">scheduler.model_worker : DSparkWorkerV2</span><span class="fqcn">sglang.srt.speculative.dspark_components.dspark_worker_v2.DSparkWorkerV2</span></div><div role="columnheader"><span class="instance">verify_forward_batch : ForwardBatch</span><span class="fqcn">sglang.srt.model_executor.forward_batch_info.ForwardBatch</span></div><div role="columnheader"><span class="instance">batch_result : GenerationBatchResult</span><span class="fqcn">sglang.srt.managers.utils.GenerationBatchResult</span></div></div>
            <div class="iso-row" role="row" data-step-node="0"><div class="iso-row__time">T0<br>入口解析</div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event iso-arrow" data-kind="guard"><b>resolve_forward_inputs(batch, future_map)</b>是否修改字段由 staging / ordinary decode / overlap spec 三组 guard 决定。</div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event" data-kind="guard"><b>纯 dSpark decode</b><code>prefill_input_ids_cpu=None</code><br><code>spec_algo.is_none()=False</code><br><code>enable_overlap=False</code><br>因此不改字段。</div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div></div>
            <div class="iso-row" role="row" data-step-node="1"><div class="iso-row__time">T1<br>事务开始</div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event iso-arrow" data-kind="guard"><b>with _forward_isolation(batch, overlap=False)</b><code>sched_snapshot={全部 dataclass 字段}</code></div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event" data-kind="data"><b>sampling_info 替换</b><code>copy_for_forward()</code> 去 orchestrator、共享已预累计 penalty buffer，避免同轮多次装配重复累计。</div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div></div>
            <div class="iso-row" role="row" data-step-node="2"><div class="iso-row__time">T2<br>worker 调用</div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event iso-arrow"><b>forward_batch_generation(batch)</b>调用同一个 <code>ScheduleBatch</code> 实例。</div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event" data-kind="data"><b>Scheduler 视图</b><code>DECODE + DFlashDraftInputV2</code></div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event"><b>DSparkWorkerV2._forward_decode()</b>提案 → 规划 → Target Verify → 接受 → hidden/KV 提交。</div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div></div>
            <div class="iso-row" role="row" data-step-node="3"><div class="iso-row__time">T3<br>Target 装配</div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event iso-arrow" data-kind="guard"><b>DFlashVerifyInput.prepare_for_verify()</b><code>input_ids=verify_tensor</code><br><code>spec_info=verify_input</code><br><code>forward_mode=TARGET_VERIFY</code></div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event iso-arrow"><b>ForwardBatch.init_new(...)</b><code>capture_hidden_mode=FULL</code></div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event" data-kind="data"><b>捕获执行引用</b><code>input_ids → verify_tensor#V</code><br><code>spec_info → verify_input#Q</code><br><code>forward_mode=TARGET_VERIFY</code></div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div></div>
            <div class="iso-row" role="row" data-step-node="4"><div class="iso-row__time">T4<br>worker 返回</div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event iso-arrow" data-kind="return"><b>return batch_result</b>Target 已完成、接受边界已确定、下一轮对象已构造。</div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event" data-kind="return"><b>执行已完成</b>Target forward 在 worker 返回前消费完捕获字段；异步 tensor 生命周期由 stream/lifetime 机制保护。</div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event" data-kind="data"><b>待提交结果</b><code>next_draft_input(anchor=Y)</code><br><code>new_seq_lens=[22]</code></div></div></div>
            <div class="iso-row" role="row" data-step-node="5"><div class="iso-row__time">T5<br>finally</div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event iso-arrow" data-kind="guard"><b>restore snapshot</b><code>for name,value: setattr(batch,name,value)</code></div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"><div class="iso-event" data-kind="data"><b>原视图恢复</b><code>input_ids=None</code><br><code>spec_info=DFlashDraftInputV2(X)</code><br><code>forward_mode=DECODE</code><br><code>seq_lens=[20]</code></div></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div><div class="iso-row__cell"></div></div>
